 pin 48 (`BBP1`) seems to be connected to the same net as pin 64 (`BBP2`)?\\nActually, it's hard to see. But SCUD says \\\"BBP (Pin 64)\\\".\\nI'll stick with Pin 64.\\n\\nI'll add R20 and C12.\\n\"}",
