        "arguments": "{\"thought\": \"Now I will add the detailed connections for the Power Supply and Decoupling.\\n\\n**Power Supply Logic:**\\n*   `BAT` (U1-1) -> R5 -> `PWR` net.\\n*   C5 on `BAT` pin to GND.\\n*   `PWR` -> R4 -> R3 -> Q1(C).\\n*   C1 on Q1(C) to GND.\\n*   Q1(E) -> `LDOIN`.\\n*   Q1(B) -> `NPNB` (U1-48).\\n*   C59 on `LDOIN` to GND.\\n*   C3 on `NEG5V` to GND.\\n*   C2 on `TSREF` to GND.\\n*   C6 on `AVDD` to GND.\\n*   C9 on `AVDD` to GND (Wait, SCUD says C6, C9, C7, C8 for AVDD/CVDD/DVDD. Let's check mapping).\\n    *   SCUD: \\\"AVDD/CVDD/DVDD: Decoupled by C6 (1uF), C9 (1uF), C7 (4.7uF), C8 (1uF).\\\"\\n    *   Usually:\\n        *   AVDD: C6\\n        *   CVDD: C9\\n        *   DVDD: C8\\n        *   Maybe C7 is on one of them or shared?\\n        *   Let's look at `subckt_bq79616_ic.png` if I could, but I can't.\\n        *   Standard practice: One cap per pin.\\n        *   Let's assume:\\n            *   AVDD (Pin 38): C6\\n            *   CVDD (Pin 45): C9\\n            *   DVDD (Pin 49): C8\\n            *   C7 (4.7uF) is likely on the main regulator output or shared. Let's put it on CVDD or DVDD. Or maybe AVDD.\\n            *   Let's check the SCUD again. \\\"AVDD/CVDD/DVDD: Decoupled by C6, C9, C7, C8\\\".\\n            *   I'll put C6 on AVDD, C9 on CVDD, C8 on DVDD. I'll put C7 on CVDD as well (often the core digital supply needs bulk). Or maybe AVDD. I'll put it on CVDD for now.\\n\\n**NPN Pinout:**\\n*   MMBT3904LT1G: Pin 1=Base, Pin 2=Emitter, Pin 3=Collector.\\n*   SCUD: Q1(C) -> R3. Q1(E) -> LDOIN. Q1(B) -> NPNB.\\n*   So:\\n    *   Q1.pin3 -> R3.pin2\\n    *   Q1.pin2 -> net.LDOIN\\n    *   Q1.pin1 -> net.NPNB\\n\\n**R4/R3 Series:**\\n*   PWR -> R4 -> R3 -> Q1(C).\\n*   R4.pin1 -> PWR\\n*   R4.pin2 -> R3.pin1\\n*   R3.pin2 -> Q1.pin3\\n\\n**C1:**\\n*   On Collector of Q1.\\n*   C1.pin1 -> Q1.pin3 (or R3.pin2)\\n*   C1.pin2 -> GND\\n\\n**U1 Connections:**\\n*   U1.BAT -> R5.pin1\\n*   R5.pin2 -> PWR\\n*   C5.pin1 -> U1.BAT\\n*   C5.pin2 -> GND\\n*   U1.NPNB -> net.NPNB\\n\\nI will add these connections. I will also add the LED D1.\\n\\n**LED D1:**\\n*   Green LED D1 with R121 (1.0k) and Jumper J6.\\n*   SCUD: \\\"Indicator: Green LED D1 with R121 (1.0k) and Jumper J6 (Power Indicator).\\\"\\n*   Usually: PWR -> J6 -> R121 -> D1 -> GND.\\n*   Or: PWR -> R121 -> D1 -> J6 -> GND.\\n*   Let's assume standard: PWR -> J6 -> R121 -> D1 -> GND.\\n*   I need to declare J6, R121, D1.\\n\\nI'll update the file.\"}",
        "origin": "completion"
